WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.660
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.660
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.890
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.890
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.730
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.730
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.940
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.940
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.900
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.900
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.860
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.860
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.870
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.870
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.920
Keep your eyes on me, okay!?

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.920
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:36.110
My name is Kurata Sana, first year
junior high school student.

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:38.160
Aoki - Award winning writer, Mama.

00:01:38.160 --> 00:01:39.990
My manager, Rei-kun.

00:01:39.990 --> 00:01:42.160
The mysterious white bat Babbit.

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:44.500
DDT kills all mosquitoes.

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:47.250
Hayama Akito, my childhood friend.

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:50.630
Matsui Fuka, my best friend with an
western accent.

00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:55.550
Sana-chan Who Cannot
Love Completely

00:01:58.090 --> 00:02:01.600
For lunch, I want to eat onigiri...

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:05.220
I want to wrap some salmon,
fish eggs, plum and dried fish...

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:09.690
Mushrooms, seaweed, and tuna,
banana, strawberries...

00:02:09.690 --> 00:02:12.440
Banana and strawberries
in the onigiri?

00:02:12.770 --> 00:02:15.990
It's possible, right?
No way!

00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:17.900
Ice Cream.

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:19.160
What kind of English is that?

00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:21.660
Banana and strawberries are snacks.

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:23.330
What kind of Japanese is that?

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:27.080
Because it's your business,
I'll pretend you're serious.

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:29.170
That's the way I am...

00:02:29.170 --> 00:02:31.670
Maybe if we try to make that,
it'll taste good.

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:33.500
Yeah, these parts are
just like me...

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:36.420
- Sana-chan, where are you?
- I'm right here!

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:37.420
There's also...

00:02:37.420 --> 00:02:38.880
Oh, right here...

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:43.890
Sana-chan, what are you going to wear for the press conference?

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:46.430
- Octopus sausage!
- Octopus sausage?

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:50.350
I am Kurata Sana and this is
my costume, octopus sausage.

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:51.690
Octopus won't do!

00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:53.310
...and tomato salad...

00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:55.360
And lettuce and spaghetti...

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:57.820
with tomato sauce on top...

00:02:57.820 --> 00:02:59.400
She's ignoring me?

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:02.160
Talking about lunch for tomorrow's
field trip.

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:05.370
Fuka says that Hayama is
interesting.

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:09.790
What's so interesting about
Caterpillar Hayama? I don't get it.

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:13.920
Interesting means having a good
impression of the other person.

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:19.090
Telling me means Sana has
an objection to this.

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:21.340
Growing up, growing up...

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:22.470
- But...
- But?

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:25.970
But Fuka grew up in Osaka where
comedy originated.

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:27.220
I got it!

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:31.480
Maybe Hayama has comedy potential
and she noticed it!

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:33.150
What are you talking about?

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:35.520
Fuka has a good eye,
that can't be wrong!

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:38.280
Even the deadpanned face of Hayama
can't get by her unnoticed.

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:39.440
So it's like that.

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:42.410
Sana-chan, you haven't decided
on the clothes yet!

00:03:42.410 --> 00:03:45.280
Sana being clueless about love
hasn't changed.

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:46.530
Devastated Mama.

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:51.040
Sana... "My Daughter and I - Part 2" is
probably going to be about this.

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:53.460
Going on a trip, trip...

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:58.170
Will there be Koala bears?

00:03:58.170 --> 00:04:01.050
Of course, they'll have all of
Aya-chan's favorite animals.

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:02.760
Koala-kun, we're here.

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:04.260
Who's Koala-kun?

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:05.470
What'd I just say?

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:06.760
What's wrong, Akito-kun?

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:07.970
I'm dizzy.

00:04:07.970 --> 00:04:10.140
Getting carsick-that's rare.

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:12.020
I occasionally get carsick.

00:04:12.440 --> 00:04:14.650
Akito-kun, now is not the time
to get carsick...

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:17.770
Today's field trip is a chance for
Akito-kun...

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:21.150
Class 1 and Class 8 keeps Akito-kun and Sana-chan far apart.

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:23.990
This is a good chance for them
to be together.

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:28.330
Akito-kun... Everyone who is eating,
sorry for the trouble.

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:30.580
Sorry to ask you for a favor
while you're sick...

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:32.290
Hayama-kun,
but can you take a picture for us?

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:34.750
A picture of just me and
Tsuyoshi-kun...

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:36.500
A very good idea, Aya-chan.

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:40.960
Right, right! Akito-kun, look at
me and Aya-chan, we're a good example.

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:43.090
You'll admire us...

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:47.090
...and then you'll want to be
just like us, Akito-kun.

00:04:47.350 --> 00:04:49.430
What are you thinking?

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:50.680
N... Nothing.

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:51.640
Sorry, Akito-kun.

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:52.890
Need more shots?

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:54.440
Just one more, one more...

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:55.940
Oh yeah, tell Sana-chan to come over.

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:57.900
Where's Sana-chan's bus #8?

00:04:57.900 --> 00:04:59.110
Hey, Akito-kun...

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:01.360
Take a photo with Sana-chan...

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:02.690
Later.

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:04.110
Akito-kun...

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:07.320
Akito-kun...
it won't work this way!

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:09.780
My wonderful plan will go down
the drain!

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:12.830
Did I spill too much already?
Right, Akito-kun?

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:17.880
Akito-kun, Akito-kun...

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:20.250
I won't let you mess it up, Hayama!

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:22.840
I will be alone with
Sana-chan today!

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:25.300
Getting too agitated will result
in a bloody nose.

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:28.090
See, it's bloody. It's starting...

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:31.350
To everyone that's eating, sorry.

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:33.350
Ok, ok... again...

00:05:33.350 --> 00:05:34.770
Nice shot.

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:37.230
This time it's your turn, Fuka.

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:38.480
Looks like we have to meet.

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:41.480
Listen! No feeding your lunches to
the animals...

00:05:41.480 --> 00:05:43.110
Take the trash with you...

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:45.780
Try to travel in groups...

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:48.240
Listen to your teacher's words,
junior high...

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:49.620
Is this a kindergarten field trip?

00:05:49.620 --> 00:05:50.740
Who said that?

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:52.620
It's Aki again.

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:56.500
Right, it's Aki. Geez, getting on the teacher's
nerves already.

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:59.460
Is this what's so interesting about
him?

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:02.920
I want to ask... Nah,
it's probably better not to...

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:05.380
Dismissed!

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:13.100
Babbit isn't a tamed animal.

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:16.480
What a big zoo!

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:21.150
Sana... lt's a weasel.

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:26.070
Yo!

00:06:26.070 --> 00:06:27.150
Yo...

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:30.070
Are there lions here?

00:06:30.070 --> 00:06:31.160
Lions?

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:35.790
Wouldn't having lions around be
very scary?

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:37.540
None here? How come?

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:41.380
Hey, wasn't Tsuyoshi-kun with you?

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:43.750
Who wants to go with them on their
honeymoon?

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:48.970
After getting to junior high, their
relationship has gotten more serious.

00:06:48.970 --> 00:06:51.260
Looking at them is kind of
embarrassing.

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:53.800
Sana? Sana, where are you?

00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:57.270
It's always like this,
I just kept on talking.

00:06:57.850 --> 00:06:59.270
Sorry.

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:03.690
What?
You're with caterpillar Hayama.

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:05.860
Later.

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:10.910
Did I interrupt you guys?

00:07:10.910 --> 00:07:12.570
What do you mean?

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:17.450
Being nice to someone I don't like
isn't truly being nice.

00:07:29.720 --> 00:07:32.970
Those monkeys are angry. Scary!

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:35.100
I wonder what's wrong with
the monkeys?

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:36.430
Fuka!

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:38.310
Who am I?

00:07:38.310 --> 00:07:39.560
What are you doing?

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:41.770
Nothing, monkeys like me.

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:44.440
Oh look, Fuka...

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:48.070
A monkey riding a deer! That's
really rare and really weird!

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:50.610
Having monkeys hanging on you is
even weirder.

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:52.320
I guess so.

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:56.160
Monkeys riding on Babbit.

00:07:57.370 --> 00:08:01.000
Sana, you have a press conference
tomorrow, right?

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:02.420
Yeah, that's right.

00:08:02.420 --> 00:08:04.750
Is it okay to have monkeys
hanging on you?

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:06.000
It's ok.

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:07.630
Don't you need to prepare first?

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:08.670
No.

00:08:08.670 --> 00:08:10.420
What kind of movie is it?

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:15.090
Sorry, the script isn't ready yet so I don't know, but I think it's a tragic love story.

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:19.970
The director is Ono Miki or
something...

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:24.440
You don't mean the director
Ono Mikio?

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:26.690
Yeah, that's it, Fuka,
you know a lot.

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:27.570
You know him?

00:08:27.570 --> 00:08:30.570
Ono Mikio is very famous, isn't he?

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:33.280
No one can do a love story better
than him.

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:35.610
He's the younger generation's
favorite director.

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:37.070
Really?

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:41.750
Really? You're the main character
of this movie, right?

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:43.460
Yeah, that's what Rei-kun said.

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:46.830
What he said? Geez, strange...

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:47.880
Fine.

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:50.090
Yeah, that's what people always say
about me.

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:52.210
Well, I guess that's
where your attraction is.

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:53.340
Thank you.

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:55.300
Hold it... is that a compliment?

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:56.340
Scene change.

00:08:56.340 --> 00:08:57.760
Aya-chan, smile!

00:08:57.760 --> 00:08:59.760
Tsuyoshi-kun, are the penguins
in it too?

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:01.720
These penguins are so cute.

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:04.480
Aya-chan is many times more cute
than they are.

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:05.810
Oh my, Tsuyoshi-kun.

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:10.070
I wouldn't say lines like that!
I really mean it...

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:11.480
I'm a genius.

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:14.610
Akito-kun,
did you meet up with...

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:15.860
Sana-chan?

00:09:15.860 --> 00:09:18.490
Now that their classes are
really far apart...

00:09:18.490 --> 00:09:21.330
if you don't keep an eye on them,
they'll grow apart...

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:22.750
then it would be lonely.

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:26.620
You're so worried about
Hayama-kun. You're so considerate.

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:27.580
Aya-chan!

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:29.750
I've had enough of you two getting
so lovey lovely.

00:09:34.010 --> 00:09:36.220
So many animals are gathered.

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:37.550
Are there lions here?

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:38.510
Idiot!

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:40.680
If there were lions just waiting
around to pounce, wouldn't that be scary?

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:42.140
Yeah, that would be scary.

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:44.480
I asked Hayama the same question.

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:46.640
Eh?

00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:49.020
No way, there aren't any lions,
right?

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:50.980
I hope there aren't.

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:52.320
Yeah.

00:09:56.030 --> 00:09:57.400
I'm not a lion.

00:09:57.570 --> 00:10:00.320
It's only the bloody nose
classmate... still don't know his name.

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:02.740
Dangerous! Can't believe they're
here too!

00:10:02.740 --> 00:10:04.830
Fuka! Didn't you say
there weren't any lions?!

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:06.870
Don't talk about it now!
I'm leaving first.

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:09.630
- Fuka, get behind me!
- Why?

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:15.090
Oh Sana-chan's here too!

00:10:15.090 --> 00:10:17.340
I didn't think I'd meet you here.

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:20.930
Why are you running?
It's me, it's me! Zenjiro, Zenjiro!

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:24.430
I'm doing a TV show Zen Zen's
Garden right now.

00:10:24.430 --> 00:10:25.850
It was a co-worker's idea.

00:10:25.850 --> 00:10:29.480
Dress up as a lion, scare
the animals and see the animals' reactions...

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:33.020
Sana-chan, since you're here
anyway why not be a guest, too?

00:10:34.730 --> 00:10:36.240
Ouch!

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:39.360
Wait a minute, aren't you a skunk?

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:42.070
Don't do anything or else
I won't forgive you!

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:44.580
I was attacked by skunks before
and I've smelled enough!

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:46.450
Don't do it again... no...

00:10:46.450 --> 00:10:49.580
Don't face your butt towards me...
hey, hey...

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:54.040
To the people who are eating,
sorry.

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:56.210
Lunchtime continued.

00:10:56.420 --> 00:10:58.470
Lunch Time!

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:01.510
It looks powerful.

00:11:02.010 --> 00:11:04.560
You're interested in weird things
again.

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:07.770
Akito-kun, did you get to talk
with Sana-chan?

00:11:07.770 --> 00:11:08.810
Yeah.

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:11.440
I heard Sana-chan has a press
conference tomorrow.

00:11:11.440 --> 00:11:12.940
Did you know about that?

00:11:13.190 --> 00:11:14.770
So...?

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:18.400
You and Sana-chan aren't
in the same class.

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:23.030
Sana-chan is gonna be busy with her
work and you won't see her much.

00:11:23.030 --> 00:11:23.910
Yeah...

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:27.240
Is this alright? Is this really
alright, Akito-kun?

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:38.460
So...

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:42.340
So, you should use today to spend
more time with her...

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:43.890
right?

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:46.680
I have Octopus sausage.

00:11:46.680 --> 00:11:49.230
What's for dessert?
What is it? Let me see.

00:11:49.230 --> 00:11:51.190
Huh, it's this!
This looks really tasty.

00:11:51.190 --> 00:11:52.730
Gimme, gimme!

00:11:54.940 --> 00:11:58.570
What is narusao?

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:04.030
The answer is monkey.

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:09.370
I want to eat lunch too.

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:11.330
Zenjiro-sensei!

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:15.880
Sana-chan's lunch looks
really good, right, Akito-kun?

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:18.550
Sana-chan,
give me an octopus sausage.

00:12:18.550 --> 00:12:19.800
No...

00:12:19.800 --> 00:12:22.260
anything but the octopus sausage...

00:12:27.140 --> 00:12:28.600
Give it back!

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:31.060
Give me back my octopus sausage!
Give it back!

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:33.190
Your...

00:12:33.190 --> 00:12:39.650
octopus... tastes really good...
yep...

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:41.440
Rocket Punch!

00:12:43.030 --> 00:12:45.780
Even though Akito-kun has a dumb
mouth...

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:50.870
the problem lies with Sana-chan
being really clueless about love.

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:53.580
I have to get to work... Roar!

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:57.170
Unforgivable! Hayama is
such a shameless person!

00:12:57.170 --> 00:12:59.800
Oh, it's the bushy eye-browed,
bloody nose classmate!

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:03.970
My name is Ishida and by the way
I'm in Class 2.

00:13:03.970 --> 00:13:06.010
His name is Ishida?

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:07.970
Right, eh, what's this?

00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:10.930
Sorry, sorry,
Ishida-kun. What's up?

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:11.970
The truth is...

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:13.850
The truth is what?

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:16.100
The truth is I...

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:18.810
The truth is I and Sana-chan...

00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:21.070
If you have something to say,
hurry up!

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:23.320
I want to be friends with
Sana-chan...

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:24.820
What are you saying?

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:26.910
Blood squirting everywhere...

00:13:27.240 --> 00:13:29.740
that sure scared me...

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:32.950
Ishida-kun...
does him just talking...

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:36.500
to girls during class give him
a bloody nose?

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:39.170
Really clueless...

00:13:39.170 --> 00:13:41.670
That's because he's nervous in your
presence...

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:43.210
Sana-chan!

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:46.180
Can you come over for a minute?

00:13:46.180 --> 00:13:47.380
Sure...

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:56.730
I'm sorry to say this, I've always
thought you were really dense...

00:13:57.520 --> 00:13:59.690
Are you really as dense as this...?

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:05.530
Akito-kun's feelings... Haven't you noticed how he feels?

00:14:07.820 --> 00:14:10.700
Hayama's feelings?

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:16.790
That's right, his feelings
for Sana-chan... he likes you.

00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:19.460
Did Hayama tell you he likes me,
Tsuyoshi-kun?

00:14:20.580 --> 00:14:23.340
Did he ever say it or not?

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:26.760
He didn't say it out loud
but I know he does...

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:28.840
How do you know?

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:31.800
If you can read other people's
thoughts, you must be psychic!

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:34.970
Psychic? What are you talking about,
Sana-chan?

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:39.060
You're acting really weird,
Sana-chan...

00:14:39.190 --> 00:14:41.520
I was weird in the first place.

00:14:41.520 --> 00:14:43.860
Sana-chan, stop this and be more
serious...

00:14:45.230 --> 00:14:49.280
It's because I'm really worried
about you and Akito-kun!

00:15:02.500 --> 00:15:04.130
Sorry...

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:09.380
Sorry... Tsuyoshi-kun,
maybe I should tell you the truth...

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:11.050
The truth?

00:15:12.340 --> 00:15:15.180
I don't have confidence
when it comes to love.

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:21.480
Last year, I was full of confidence,
I really thought I was in love.

00:15:21.480 --> 00:15:23.150
Oh yeah, with your manager...

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:24.940
That's right, with Rei-kun!

00:15:24.940 --> 00:15:27.780
Yeah...
there was something like that.

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:31.570
That wasn't... wasn't love...

00:15:31.570 --> 00:15:34.580
That was a mistake...
When I realized it...

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:38.540
I was really humiliated and
in shock...

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:40.910
Just thinking of it makes me feel
humiliated...

00:15:40.910 --> 00:15:42.500
Really?

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:45.630
So, the problem with Hayama...

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:50.670
even if I think he likes me,
I could be mistaken again...

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:54.090
After thinking about it for
long time, I don't want to think about it anymore.

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:58.060
I still don't understand people's
feelings...

00:15:58.680 --> 00:16:00.930
I need to be told straight out...

00:16:01.520 --> 00:16:07.070
Well... ok... but how do you feel
about Akito-kun?

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:09.280
Didn't I already say that
I didn't know?

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:16.990
Male friends... like Hayama-kun,
you, Naozumi-kun and Rei-kun...

00:16:16.990 --> 00:16:18.620
I like you all...

00:16:21.460 --> 00:16:26.080
But... I can't tell the difference
between friendship and love...

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:27.540
Is kissing on the lips love?

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:31.420
But in the future, with work, there
will be a lot of such kissing scenes.

00:16:33.090 --> 00:16:37.260
I wish I could ask other girls in love...

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:42.100
So when and where does love begin?

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:46.770
I don't understand love at all...

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:50.530
so I don't really want to think
about it right now...

00:16:50.530 --> 00:16:53.610
And I'll be busier and busier
with work too...

00:16:54.280 --> 00:16:55.700
Right?

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:56.990
Sana-chan...

00:16:56.990 --> 00:16:59.490
Let's go... we need to meet with the others...

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:07.460
Hmm... I don't know about that...

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:09.130
Sana!

00:17:10.050 --> 00:17:12.970
I bought it at the souvenir store.
Isn't it cute?

00:17:12.970 --> 00:17:16.470
I want to buy something too!
Is there a clothing store?

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:19.140
I don't think so...

00:17:19.760 --> 00:17:20.760
Ouch!

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:23.100
What are you doing up there, Hayama?

00:17:23.100 --> 00:17:24.020
Come over for a sec...

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:25.980
- What?
- Just come...

00:17:25.980 --> 00:17:29.440
Ahhh! I'm going to get butchered!

00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:32.110
Butchered?
They have a good relationship.

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:35.200
Yeah, they've had a unique
relationship since sixth grade.

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:36.320
What do you mean?

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:38.240
That's what I wanted to ask you...

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:40.950
Right, right...

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:43.620
I don't know...

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:49.750
Wow! It's beautiful!

00:17:50.170 --> 00:17:51.550
Yeah...

00:17:51.550 --> 00:17:53.460
Beautiful! Beautiful!

00:17:56.090 --> 00:17:59.680
So this is what
he wanted to show me?

00:18:07.350 --> 00:18:11.400
Being nice to someone I don't like
isn't truly being nice.

00:18:12.610 --> 00:18:15.940
Akito-kun's feelings? Haven't you
noticed how he feels about you?

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:20.570
The right part of my body is getting
a weird electric shock.

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:23.580
Now that we're here,
what does he want to do?

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:26.410
Tomorrow...

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:30.960
Tomorrow... about the movie...

00:18:30.960 --> 00:18:33.840
Ah... yeah...
it's a press conference...

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:36.210
Are you sure you can just spend
the day before relaxing?

00:18:36.210 --> 00:18:38.880
It's alright, I've already met
the cast members...

00:18:38.880 --> 00:18:40.970
Asako-san and Naozumi-kun...

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:43.390
Kamura-kun... is also in it?

00:18:43.390 --> 00:18:44.350
Yeah.

00:18:44.350 --> 00:18:46.600
This... I didn't hear about it.

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:49.730
Yeah... forgot to tell you.

00:18:57.740 --> 00:18:59.320
The movie...

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:04.530
after it starts filming, we won't
be able see much of each other...

00:19:07.700 --> 00:19:13.340
Not seeing each other will
probably be lonely...

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:17.670
Lonely...

00:19:17.670 --> 00:19:21.760
That's okay... as long as we're not dead...

00:19:23.180 --> 00:19:26.390
Even dead, we can meet...

00:19:26.970 --> 00:19:28.430
...as ghosts...

00:19:29.690 --> 00:19:31.900
Ghost? I'm one...

00:19:33.770 --> 00:19:36.820
I'm playing a ghost in the movie...

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:39.780
Really?

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:46.410
It's strange... suddenly I have
the desire to act in a movie...

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:47.870
Really?

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:51.160
That's great...

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:55.170
It's really weird though...

00:19:55.170 --> 00:20:00.630
his words don't seem like anything,
it touches me deep within my heart.

00:20:01.470 --> 00:20:03.470
I knew it...

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:06.810
...knew it...

00:20:07.930 --> 00:20:11.020
Don't think about things like that!

00:20:12.100 --> 00:20:13.650
Complicated.

00:20:15.730 --> 00:20:18.900
So Hayama only wanted to show you
some scenery?

00:20:18.900 --> 00:20:21.400
Yeah, I guess so.

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:23.610
Didn't know about you two...

00:20:24.610 --> 00:20:26.950
Don't say it like that!

00:20:26.950 --> 00:20:29.450
Why does everybody immediately
assume that?!

00:20:29.450 --> 00:20:30.870
Don't be so angry.

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:33.330
Why are you getting so mad over
what I said?

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:35.670
You only want to
know Hayama's motives!

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:36.840
I get it, I get it...

00:20:36.840 --> 00:20:38.550
Now I know so you don't need to say anymore.

00:20:38.550 --> 00:20:41.050
If you don't wipe your mouth,
it'll stay dirty.

00:20:41.050 --> 00:20:44.720
I need to think about tomorrow's
press conference.

00:20:44.720 --> 00:20:46.680
Don't talk to me!

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:49.680
Didn't you say that you were
already mentally prepared?

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:50.970
At sixes and sevens.

00:20:50.970 --> 00:20:52.390
Mind your own business, please!

00:20:52.390 --> 00:20:54.310
You're really strange!

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:57.110
Annoying! Annoying!

00:20:58.150 --> 00:21:00.570
You're weird!
Taking a toy out like that!

00:21:00.900 --> 00:21:02.530
Wait a minute!

00:21:02.820 --> 00:21:04.780
At the press conference
in the water world

00:21:02.990 --> 00:21:04.910
It's already the next day.

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:06.280
I never heard this before!

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:08.330
For this movie, Sana-chan was
suppose to be the main character!

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:13.210
According to the director,
Kamura-kun is the main character.

00:21:13.210 --> 00:21:14.250
How can that be!

00:21:14.250 --> 00:21:17.000
Of course Sana-chan
has a memorable part.

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:20.380
So really, there are two main leads,
Kamura Naozumi and Kurata Sana.

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:22.130
So that's the story... Farewell!

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:23.840
This won't work!

00:21:23.840 --> 00:21:27.800
Now Naozumi-kun will be more
popular and nobody will know Sana-chan!

00:21:27.800 --> 00:21:31.310
All my efforts for Sana-chan are wasted!

00:21:31.310 --> 00:21:32.600
It's nothing to be upset about...

00:21:32.600 --> 00:21:35.440
What are you angry for, Rei-kun?
This is okay...

00:21:35.440 --> 00:21:38.150
We only want to act well
in our own roles, right?

00:21:38.150 --> 00:21:42.360
If that's the case, your popularity
will be taken by Sana-chan! Be careful...

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:44.030
You're still just feeling cheated!

00:21:44.030 --> 00:21:46.570
I just want to
act well for the movie.

00:21:46.570 --> 00:21:48.320
Ah, that sounds like a good plan...

00:21:49.450 --> 00:21:52.620
Naozumi-kun
is playing a normal kid.

00:21:52.620 --> 00:21:54.830
Looking forward
to the press conference.

00:21:54.830 --> 00:21:56.250
It's starting!

00:21:56.960 --> 00:21:59.920
Everyone...
the press conference has started...

00:21:59.920 --> 00:22:02.590
Akito-kun, Sana-chan is coming out...

00:22:02.590 --> 00:22:04.090
Look... look...

00:22:04.090 --> 00:22:06.130
I've seen her everyday...
don't get so excited...

00:22:07.590 --> 00:22:09.550
Sana looks like a totally different
person...

00:22:09.550 --> 00:22:11.510
Sana-chan is so cool!

